<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUGSY: So you’re the one who went\ndown the well with my student.\fHalf the town’s talking about it.\rI could battle you myself. I’ve\ndecided not to. Turk needs this\fmore than I need a win--and after\nthis morning, so does this town.\rA clean, honest gym match.\nSomething that makes SENSE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUGSY: THAT’S a gym battle. Both\nof you--that’s exactly what one\fshould look like.\rYou out-lasted the wall and\nout-thought the bite.\rThe Hive Badge is yours, and you\nearned every minute of it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\nthe Hive Badge!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUGSY: And take this. TM89--\nU-turn. Strike, then come home\fbefore they can answer. Momentum.\rTurk’s whole gym is about\nENDURING; this is the other half\fof the lesson--knowing when to\nleave. Carry both.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUGSY: You both walked out of that\nwell changed.\rToday I saw what it changed INTO.\nGo west, when you’re ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: Different now, isn’t it?\nDown there we were on the same\fside. Up here I want to win.\rI’m not going to go easy because\nwe bled together. That’d be an\finsult to both of us.\rMy team doesn’t hit the hardest.\nIt LASTS. Screens, webs, a wall\fyou’ll get sick of looking at--\nand then the one that bites.\rGet through all of it. Show me you\ndeserve the first badge.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: After down there, a gym\nbattle should’ve felt simple.\fIt didn’t. You made me work for\nevery inch of it.\rThank you. For coming down with me\nwhen you didn’t have to.\rWherever you’re headed--Goldenrod,\nthrough the forest--I hope it’s\fquieter than our morning was.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: And if Silver keeps his word\nabout our SLOWPOKE... then maybe\fheroes are real after all.\rHe came so FAST, didn’t he.\r...Anyway. Go. The forest’s just\nwest. Watch the trees--they’ve\fgotten strange.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0567_T23GYM0102_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TURK: The forest’s just west.\nWatch the trees--they’ve gotten\fstrange.\rAnd come back sometime. This gym\nremembers its friends.</language>
	</row>
</body>
